<section class="pv-transport-discovery" aria-labelledby="transport-discovery-heading"><p class="pv-eyebrow">Passenger flights &amp; pet arrangements</p><h2 id="transport-discovery-heading">Explore your passenger journey</h2><article class="pv-itinerary-card pv-passenger-first"><p class="pv-eyebrow">Passenger options first</p><h3>Find a flight for you, then confirm your pet’s place.</h3><% if(discovery.passenger.confirmed){ %><p>Manually confirmed departure: <strong><%= discovery.passenger.departureAirport || discovery.passenger.departureCity %></strong><% if(discovery.passenger.departureCity&&discovery.passenger.departureAirport){ %> · <%= discovery.passenger.departureCity %><% } %>. This is your trip departure, not a verification of your pet’s residence history.</p><% }else{ %><p><strong>Confirm where you’re flying from.</strong> No departure city or airport has been confirmed. The link below is a broad country search only; edit your trip details for a more specific search.</p><% } %><% if(discovery.passenger.departureDate){ %><p>Depart: <%= discovery.passenger.departureDate %><% if(discovery.passenger.returnDate){ %> · Return: <%= discovery.passenger.returnDate %><% } %></p><% } %><p>Many travellers plan to travel with their pets. Check the operating airline’s cabin or hold policy, the pet booking and every segment before buying. A passenger ticket does not reserve a place for your pet.</p><a class="pv-button" href="<%= discovery.passenger.url %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><%= discovery.passenger.confirmed?'Search passenger flights':'Open broad passenger search' %> ↗</a><p class="pv-fine-print"><%= discovery.passenger.note %></p><p><a href="https://cheapoair.tpk.mx/WFCmLZT6" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer sponsored">Compare passenger fares at CheapOair ↗</a></p><p class="pv-fine-print">Affiliate link: PetVoyage may earn a commission. Opens the booking homepage; re-enter your route and dates there. Prices and availability are provided there, not by PetVoyage. It does not book pet transport.</p><p><a data-airport-finder="true" href="/flights/searchFlights?legacy=1">Use my location / find nearby airports →</a></p><p class="pv-fine-print">Opens our Airport route finder. If you allow browser location access, precise location can be sent to Google Maps. Manual entry is available.</p></article><h2 class="mt-4">Your pet’s transport arrangements</h2><p class="pv-fine-print">Reviewed research, separate from AI and from passenger ticket availability.</p><div class="pv-note"><span class="pv-transport-pill"><%= discovery.state==='reviewed-enquiry'?'Separate cargo enquiry candidate':'Pet transport needs review' %></span><p><%= discovery.summary %></p><% if(discovery.assistanceNote){ %><p><%= discovery.assistanceNote %></p><% } %><% if(discovery.transitNote){ %><p><%= discovery.transitNote %></p><% } %></div><div class="pv-discovery-grid"><% discovery.candidates.forEach(candidate=>{ %><article class="pv-itinerary-card"><p class="pv-eyebrow">Separate animal transport · <%= candidate.transportMode %></p><h3><%= candidate.name %></h3><p><strong><%= candidate.originAirportName %> (<%= candidate.originAirport %>) → <%= candidate.animalEntryAirportName %> (<%= candidate.animalEntryAirport %>)</strong></p><p><%= candidate.supportedClaim %></p><p><%= candidate.positioning %></p><ul><% candidate.constraints.forEach(item=>{ %><li><%= item %></li><% }) %></ul><a class="pv-button" href="<%= candidate.enquiryUrl %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official cargo enquiry ↗</a><p class="pv-fine-print"><%= candidate.operatingCarrierStatus %> No quote or booking is created. Checked <%= candidate.reviewedAt %>; review due <%= candidate.reviewDue %>.</p><ul><% candidate.sources.forEach(source=>{ %><li><a href="<%= source.url %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><%= source.name %> ↗</a></li><% }) %></ul></article><% }) %></div><p><a href="/getCountryRegulationList">Research country requirements</a> · <a href="/regulations/airlineList">Explore airline policies</a></p></section>

<script src="/airport-handoff.js" defer></script>
